  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. At dev 100b6fbb6e there is no TypedDict anywhere in packages/*/src; schema.new_behavior_map returns Dict[str, Any]. The title's bm.json is now survey.json (ADR-0042), and symbols live under 'nodes'. The cited motivator WI-gogif is done, so that cross-ref no longer adds scope. MECHANISM: survey envelope typed Dict[str, Any]; key presence is checked only at runtime/schema validation. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-kibiz,WI-fofud,INV-zogud."  # 01b3
